Package: billie
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Samuel Roux <office@gatewaycorporate.org>
Recommends: typst
Depends: micro
Description: AI-powered TUI for the Congress.gov API
 Billie is a terminal UI for searching, comparing, and analyzing US
 legislation via the Congress.gov API, with optional AI-assisted
 analysis through any OpenAI-compatible endpoint.
 .
 PDF export requires the Typst compiler at runtime. Notebook note editing
 uses the Micro editor; other features work without these tools.
